B.Nn=new A.ed("Asha Mobile","Asha Mobile is a dedicated patient-facing hospital application for An-Nisa Hospital, engineered with strict feature modularization to streamline outpatient booking, BPJS validation, and medical record access for 50,000+ users.\n\nMain Features:\n1. Fast online specialist appointment scheduling\n2. Automated BPJS eligibility & referral validation\n3. Digital medical records & lab result access\n4. Real-time queue & hospital information updates\n\nArchitecture & Engineering:\n- Clean Architecture with feature-level modularization\n- BLoC & Provider state management with automated DI","Digital Hospital Experience for An-Nisa Hospital","Healthcare SaaS","2024 \u2013 Present","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mobileapps.asha",null,null,"assets/asha.png","50k+ Downloads",B.VA,B.US,B.Un,!0)
