B.No=new A.ed("Wise Eco App","Wise Eco App is an eco-friendly smart waste management application featuring on-device TensorFlow Lite waste classification, real-time pickup courier tracking, and a point-to-cash recycling reward system.\n\nInnovative Features:\n- On-device AI waste detection & classification using TensorFlow Lite\n- Point-to-cash reward wallet & scheduled pickup requests\n- Real-time courier GPS tracking with Google Maps & Firebase","AI-Driven Smart Waste Management & Courier Tracking","Full-Stack & AI","2022 \u2013 2023",null,null,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ggi9lQWeP0zdQr8YuWHChO7ZyRDT0b1p/view?usp=sharing","assets/wise.png","AI Showcase",B.Up,B.UU,B.TC,!1)
