B.Np=new A.ed("Klinik Nuha","Klinik Nuha connects patients with primary care clinics nationwide, offering frictionless appointment booking, centralized visit history, and digital membership management.\n\nKey Features:\n1. Streamlined clinic & practitioner appointment booking\n2. Centralized medical visit & prescription history\n3. Multi-clinic membership & family profile management","Nationwide Primary Care & Clinic Booking Platform","Healthcare SaaS","2024","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.klinik.apps",null,null,"assets/klinik.png","Play Store",B.U_,B.UV,B.UK,!1)
