B.Nr=new A.ed("Nuha Mobile","Nuha Mobile is a flagship multi-tenant healthcare SaaS application empowering patients across 100+ hospitals in Indonesia to book appointments, verify BPJS / Mobile JKN coverage, and access medical records seamlessly.\n\nCore Features:\n1. Multi-hospital online appointment booking & queue tracking\n2. National healthcare (BPJS / Mobile JKN) verification & control letters\n3. Comprehensive patient Electronic Medical Record (EMR) history\n4. Real-time doctor schedules & inpatient room availability\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n- Modular Clean Architecture engineered for 100+ hospital tenants\n- Predictable state management with BLoC & Provider\n- High-concurrency REST API integration with Go & Express.js backends","Multi-Tenant Patient Healthcare SaaS (100+ Hospitals)","Healthcare SaaS","2024 \u2013 Present","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nuha.nuha","https://apps.apple.com/id/app/nuha/id6472009062",null,"assets/nuha.png","50k+ Downloads",B.TJ,B.VV,B.UQ,!0)
