B.Ns=new A.ed("Elevate Dock & Drunner","Elevate Dock & Drunner is a custom-built local mobile CI/CD automation platform combining a modular Dart CLI engine (Drunner) with a centralized Flutter Desktop control center (Elevate Dock).\n\nKey Capabilities:\n1. Drunner CLI Engine: Executes YAML-based local CI/CD workflows standalone or via Elevate Dock\n2. Elevate Dock Desktop UI: Centralized dashboard for app configs, build pipelines, signing & live logs\n3. Automated Store Releases: Google Play publishing (Service Account JSON, production/draft tracks) & iOS TestFlight uploads with Xcode Auto/Manual Signing\n4. Shorebird OTA & Wireless ADB: Shorebird Code Push patch deployment, MAU metrics, QR wireless ADB debugging, Wi-Fi APK install & FCM notification tester","Flutter Deployment Automation Platform (Desktop UI & Dart CLI)","Dev Tooling & OSS","2024 \u2013 2025",null,null,null,null,"CLI & Desktop",null,B.Uh,B.Th,!0)
