B.Nt=new A.ed("Portal Asha","Portal Asha is an internal enterprise hospital management application tailored for An-Nisa Hospital doctors, nurses, and administrative staff to streamline clinical and HR workflows.\n\nCore Features:\n1. Role-based workflows for doctors, coordinators, and hospital staff\n2. Geofenced attendance, shift scheduling, and HRIS self-service\n3. Clinical data visualization & patient chart review for doctors\n4. Instant push notifications via Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)","Internal Hospital Operations, EMR & HRIS for An-Nisa Hospital","Healthcare SaaS","2024 \u2013 Present","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.portalasha.portal_asha",null,null,"assets/pasha.png","1k+ Downloads",B.TF,B.UG,B.UT,!1)
