B.Nu=new A.ed("Dareliman Mobile","Dareliman Mobile (Dey-ly) is an all-in-one education super-app built with Flutter and Laravel, powering student admission (PPDB), recurring tuition billing via Virtual Accounts, and live Islamic media streaming.\n\nMain Functionalities:\n- End-to-end online student registration (PPDB) & re-registration (TK\u2013SMA)\n- Automated Virtual Account (VA) & Midtrans tuition billing with parent dashboards\n- Live TV/Radio streaming, reading modules, study notes & real-time broadcasts","End-to-End School Management Super-App (TK\u2013SMA)","Enterprise & EdTech","2023 \u2013 2024","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.deyli.tech",null,null,"assets/deily.png","1k+ Downloads",B.VT,B.TV,B.Uq,!1)
