B.Nv=new A.ed("Portal Nuha","Portal Nuha is a mission-critical enterprise hospital application built for doctors, nurses, coordinators, and hospital staff across 60+ hospitals. Surpassing 10,000+ downloads, it unifies clinical Electronic Medical Records (EMR), surgery & polyclinic scheduling, and a multi-tenant SaaS HRIS into one modular super-app.\n\nKey Modules:\n1. Doctor Portal supporting Inpatient, Outpatient, ER workflows, Surgery Scheduling & EMR\n2. Multi-tenant SaaS HRIS (Geofenced Attendance, Payroll, Leave, KPI/KBI Evaluation)\n3. National Healthcare (BPJS / Mobile JKN) workflow synchronization\n4. Real-time clinical & operational alerts via Firebase Cloud Messaging\n\nTechnical Architecture:\n- Modularized Clean Architecture with strict layer separation\n- BLoC & Provider state management across multi-tenant releases\n- Supported by Go (Golang) and Express.js backend microservices","Enterprise Doctor, EMR & Multi-Tenant Hospital HRIS Portal","Healthcare SaaS","2024 \u2013 Present","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.dii.mobile_portal_nuha","https://apps.apple.com/id/app/portal-nuha/id6503646687?l=id",null,"assets/pnuha.png","10k+ Downloads",B.SL,B.Um,B.VW,!0)
